{"content":[{"c":["MILLO"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Earthen embankment or fortification mentioned in ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.9.6,20","r":"Judg.9.6,20","rawR":"Judg.9.6,20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.9.6,20","value":"Judg.9.6,20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Judges 9:6, 20"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=BethMillo_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"BethMillo_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"BethMillo_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Beth-millo"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Fortress or embankment mentioned in connection with the construction of the city of David (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.5.9","r":"2Sam.5.9","rawR":"2Sam.5.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.5.9","value":"2Sam.5.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 5:9"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.8","r":"1Chr.11.8","rawR":"1Chr.11.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.8","value":"1Chr.11.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 11:8"},"). Solomon apparently either rebuilt or expanded this fortification (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.9.15","r":"1Kgs.9.15","rawR":"1Kgs.9.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.9.15","value":"1Kgs.9.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 9:15"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.11.27","r":"1Kgs.11.27","rawR":"1Kgs.11.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.11.27","value":"1Kgs.11.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"11:27"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["Two kings of Judah are mentioned in connection with this structure: Joash was slain in “the house of Millo” (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.12.20","r":"2Kgs.12.20","rawR":"2Kgs.12.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.12.20","value":"2Kgs.12.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 12:20"},"), and Hezekiah strengthened Millo due to the threat of invasion by Sennacherib (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.32.5","r":"2Chr.32.5","rawR":"2Chr.32.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.32.5","value":"2Chr.32.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 32:5"},")."],"sourceClass":"list-text","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Millo","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4